	 * because options have wrapped to the next line. The line
	 * after the "\n" will then be padded to align with the
	 * command name, such as N_("git cmd [opt]\n<8
	 * spaces>[opt2]"), where the 8 spaces are the same length as
	 * "git cmd ".
